<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/teiis500"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2016-05-02</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Konjunkturindikator</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Business trend indicator</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Indicateur de conjoncture</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Statistische Systematik der Wirtschaftszweige in der Europäischen Gemeinschaft (NACE Rev. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Statistical classification of economic activities in the European Community (NACE Rev. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Nomenclature statistique des activités économiques dans la Communauté européenne (NACE Rév. 2)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Production in construction</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">The production in construction shows the output and activity of the construction sector. It measures changes in the volume of output on a monthly basis. Construction includes building construction and civil engineering. The construction sector in total corresponds to the NACE Rev. 2 section F. Production in construction is compiled as a &quot;fixed base year Laspeyres type volume-index&quot;. The current base year is 2021 (Index 2021 = 100). The index is presented in calendar and seasonally adjusted form. Growth rates with respect to the previous month (M/M-1) are calculated from calendar and seasonally adjusted figures while growth rates with respect to the same month of the previous year (M/M-12) are calculated from calendar adjusted figures.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Production dans la construction</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">L’indice de la production dans la construction montre la production et l’activité du secteur de la construction. Il mesure les changements mensuels du volume de la production. La construction inclut les activités relatives au bâtiment et au génie civil. Le secteur de la construction dans son ensemble se réfère à la section F de la NACE Rév. 2. L’indice de la production dans la construction est un indice de volume de type Laspeyres à base fixe. L’année de base courante est 2021 (Indice 2021 = 100). L’indice est présenté corrigé des effets de calendrier et des variations saisonnières. Les taux de croissance par rapport au mois précédent (M/M-1) sont calculés à partir de données corrigées des effets de calendrier et des variations saisonnières tandis que les taux de croissance par rapport au même mois de l’année précédente (M/M-12) sont calculés à partir de données corrigées des effets de calendrier.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Produktion im Baugewerbe</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">Der Produktionsindex für das Baugewerbe spiegelt die Produktion und die Tätigkeit des Baugewerbes wider. Er misst das Produktionsvolumen in monatlichen Abständen. Das Baugewerbe umfasst Hochbau und Tiefbau. Das Baugewerbe insgesamt entspricht der Abteilung F der NACE Rev. 2. Die Produktion im Baugewerbe wird als Volumenindex vom Typ Laspeyres mit festem Basisjahr erstellt. Das Basisjahr ist derzeit 2021 (Index 2021 = 100). Der Index wird in kalendereffekt- und saisonbereinigter Form dargestellt. Wachstumsraten bezüglich des Vormonats (M/M 1) werden auf der Grundlage von kalendereffekt- und saisonbereinigten Angaben berechnet, Wachstumsraten bezüglich des gleichen Monats im Vorjahr (M/M 12) auf der Grundlage von kalendereffektbereinigten Angaben.</dct:description><dct:identifier>teiis500</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teiis500"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NOR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GBR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MKD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/TUR"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_BT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Konjunkturindikator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Business trend indicator</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indicateur de conjoncture</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/NACE_R2" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Statistische Systematik der Wirtschaftszweige in der Europäischen Gemeinschaft (NACE Rev. 2)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Statistical classification of economic activities in the European Community (NACE Rev. 2)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Nomenclature statistique des activités économiques dans la Communauté européenne (NACE Rév. 2)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=I21_SCA"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Index, 2021=100 (SCA)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Index, 2021=100 (SCA)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indice, 2021=100 (SCA)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PCH_M12_CA"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Veränderung in Prozent m/m-12 (CA)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage change m/m-12 (CA)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Variation en pourcentage m/m-12 (CA)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PCH_M1_SCA"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Veränderung in Prozent m/m-1 (SCA)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage change m/m-1 (SCA)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Variation en pourcentage m/m-1 (SCA)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_BT?code=PRD"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Produktion (Volumen)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Production (volume)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Production (volume)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">78</stat:numSeries><dcat:theme><skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON" /></dcat:theme><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-05-20</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/MONTHLY"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-04-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-03-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teiis500"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/teiis500</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le site web d&apos;Eurostat</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="de">Mehr Informationen auf der Eurostat Website</dct:title></foaf:Document></dcat:landingPage><foaf:pag